<InfoLayout title="Privacy policy" description="How Still Coding and its connected apps handle personal data, browser storage, and permissions." eyebrow="STILL CODING / PRIVACY" locale="en">
  <div class="policy-meta"><span>Effective September 27, 2026</span><span>Updated September 27, 2026</span></div>
  <div class="policy-copy"><section><h2>1. Basic principle</h2><p>Still Coding is a web app portal operated by JH Kim. The portal currently does not offer accounts, a general contact form, payments, newsletters, or advertising identifiers. An authenticated feedback widget may appear for invited testers only; the feedback service checks submission, upload, and access permission on every request.</p></section><section><h2>2. Information handled by the portal</h2><p>Hosting and delivery infrastructure may record the URL requested, access time, and general technical information sent by a browser. Sharing and clipboard features run only when you choose them; the portal does not store the shared text in a database.</p></section><section><h2>3. App storage and permissions</h2><ul><li><strong>Kana Atelier:</strong> learning progress stays in the browser. Voice features may request microphone permission.</li><li><strong>Songnote:</strong> scores stay in this browser rather than on a server.</li><li><strong>Vocal Check:</strong> microphone input is used only for live pitch analysis in the browser. The app does not save a recording file or send audio to a server. Details are in the <a class="text-link" href="https://vocal-check.still-coding.cc/privacy/">Vocal Check privacy policy</a>.</li><li><strong>CollaBoard:</strong> signaling and WebRTC may be used for room connections. Check the app notice before sharing sensitive material.</li><li><strong>Other apps:</strong> use the latest notice inside Direct Play, Pinhole Lab, and Bus Explorer.</li></ul></section><section><h2>4. External links</h2><p>The apps linked from this portal are independently operated services. Their policies and permission requests apply after you leave this site.</p></section><section><h2>5. Contact and changes</h2><p>For privacy questions, use the <a class="text-link" href="/en/contact/">contact page</a>. This policy will be updated when the service structure changes.</p></section></div>
</InfoLayout>
